TASK: FIX THE DIAGNOSTIC ABSTENTION / GROUNDING CONTRACT

We have completed the diagnostics-only investigation.

ROOT CAUSE:
The Diagnostic Agent can legitimately abstain:

    primary_hypothesis = null
    differential_diagnoses = []

while still listing retrieved evidence IDs in:

    patient_case_evidence
    medical_knowledge_evidence

The existing grounding validator derives `used` evidence ONLY from
structured hypothesis claims:

    claims(output)
        -> rationale
        -> supporting_evidence
        -> contradicting_evidence
        -> evidence_refs

When there are no hypotheses:

    used = empty set

The validator then requires:

    patient_case_evidence == []
    medical_knowledge_evidence == []

Therefore the current model output violates the existing evidence
inventory invariant.

